  <author>Xtri training coach</author>
  <name>SWIM S08 OWS sim</name>
  <description>Åpent vann sighting 6 tak. — IMPORT: TP only accepts cycling ZWO — this file is sportType=bike so Library import works. After import: open workout → Build → set sport to Swim → convert intensity to % Threshold Pace (T-pace/CSS). Power values are % of swim T-pace (easy ~89%, CSS 100%). Set pool length in Equipment.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <tags/>
  <workout>
